{
  "note": "Hand-authored map of AMD SMI's artifacts and its four delivery channels. It is not derived from the specs -- it is an index INTO them: every node and edge names the capability that specifies it. If a claim here disagrees with the capability it cites, the capability wins and this file is wrong.",
  "title": "Build and delivery",
  "subtitle": "four channels, one tree",
